  "# Shield CLI",
  "",
  "Use `shield` when Shield's running editor/runtime is the source of truth. Use plain shell tools when Shield state does not matter.",
  "",
  "## Start Here",
  "",
  "`SHIELD` is a placeholder for the executable you resolved in the stub; substitute it before running.",
